## Interface: 16001
## Title: ForeverSearch
## Notes: Spotlight for WoW Forever: a floating search bar; type to find any item, creature, object, quest or zone (fuzzy, best first), see its details beside the list: where it drops and how often, who sells it, its auction price, how many you own; where a creature stands and what it drops. Ctrl-K, another key under Key Bindings > AddOns, or /find.
## Author: Pietjan
## Version: 0.2
## Dependencies: ForeverData
## OptionalDeps: Auctionator, Syndicator
## SavedVariables: ForeverSearchDB

Core.lua
Window.lua
